116:     /**
117:      * Main method is called in two cases:
118:      * - when the user wants to perform calibration and save results on the machine where the tool is not installed,
119:      *   so that later remote profiling can be performed on this machine. No command line args are needed.
120:      * - a backdoor usage when JF developers want to see calibration data, tune the internals etc. In that case,
121:      *   a special command line argument -develmode should be provided.
